    "field": "Integrated assessment modelling of climate change mitigation",
    "problem": "This paper addresses the challenge that meeting the 2\u00b0C climate target requires immediate, drastic emission reductions that may be infeasible, and assesses the crucial but uncertain role of negative emission technologies in allowing for more flexible, delayed-action pathways.",
    "method": "This paper uses integrated assessment modelling and stylized calculations to assess the role of negative CO2 emissions, especially from BECCS, for achieving the 2\u00b0C climate target by allowing for delayed or less immediate emission reductions.",
    "task": "The task is to assess the demand for and potential of negative CO\u2082 emissions, particularly from Bio-Energy with Carbon Capture and Storage (BECCS), in achieving pathways to limit global warming to 2\u00b0C, using insights from integrated assessment modelling.",
